{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "ec7448399730e72c7a71f2755184c0d68ed594edb99498b865a080224fa4c14d", "ja": "マーケットリサーチです！", "zh": "Marketing research！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e04b64c487ac4766112543b93d55f6a2b6ff77e5f01971233c846f7451292c64", "ja": "レトロポップを知るために、懐かしミュージ\nアムへと向かう歩達。そこで、ひとりで出て\nいったはずの桃子と遭遇する。ユニットの\nことを考えてくれていた桃子に歩は感動し、\nロコはアイディアをひとつの形にしていく。", "zh": "为了更理解怀旧复古风，步等人来到\n怀旧博物馆。在那里，他们遇到了\n先前一个人跑出去的桃子。\n看到桃子为了团体着想，步非常感动，\nROCO则开始把灵感化为一个具体的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cac3d87352a585f92ee04d3d82f153789ac5fc1d9e747546be81ee2ed60eadaf", "ja": "{$P$}！\nも、桃子は……？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n桃、桃子呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9adcaddb9912ec22cbc0bfdf5ff5515ff8241109774eef57a72aff041c3d4078", "ja": "自分のことはいいから、\n話し合いを続けてほしいそうだ。", "zh": "她说不必顾虑她，\n希望我们继续讨论下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "efcd042a28ff998d7730c33e69c08f9af71f6f76904e5d8ace432ce157464c9a", "ja": "ええ～～～～っ！！", "zh": "咦咦～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "efcd042a28ff998d7730c33e69c08f9af71f6f76904e5d8ace432ce157464c9a", "ja": "ええ～～～～っ！！", "zh": "咦咦～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c6a28ca286040f315967f36b71b08c27778e0e01180403b7d192c2e8faabd33e", "ja": "もしかして、アタシの説明がマズかった！？\n桃子のこと、子ども扱いしちゃったし……。", "zh": "不会是我说明得太差了吧！？\n都是我把桃子当作小孩子看待才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "73753b3ae81b1ceb56b9384c22c17c8d790aac7a697ef51306dafe41bf1dd86a", "ja": "オレが思いつきで、ホットケーキとか\n言っちゃったからかな……？", "zh": "是因为我没想太多\n就提议说了松饼什么的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cca4d497aee554ea643a3b35f16acd25a760e347003aaa3acebac7e98883adff", "ja": "いや、桃子は別に怒ったわけじゃなさそうだ。\n自分がいるとみんなが気を使うからって。", "zh": "不，桃子好像没有在生气。\n她说担心她在场会让我们有所顾虑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c6dfd44eda0b291410db845f16d7dce0bc3bba2fbe26e1094ed6a0d8d739d30b", "ja": "えっ……。\nいや、でもさぁ……。", "zh": "咦……\n不，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "00ac7ebfe7419e25335fc9c290b882384401ba73cf0b0ea57041bd9c38e8d80e", "ja": "なあ、ロコは桃子のこと、\nほっといていいって思うか？", "zh": "我说，ROCO你觉得\n放着桃子不管这样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "77adca59d6dad270f9a8d7947461af7082e99417d36cf4f6a71c1e33079c0628", "ja": "……ガレージロックのストリームにグループサウンズの\nコーラスも取り入れて……ブツブツ……。", "zh": "……在Garage rock的Stream之中加入Group sounds的\nChorus……（自言自语）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "f7fcb379244e35c2820b4d9288a15f1529ad38859b76b25b71508789400bc43e", "ja": "ってダメだ～。こうなっちゃうと、\nロコは周りのこと気にしなくなるんだよなぁ。", "zh": "唉不行啦～只要进入这个状态，\nROCO就会不在意周围发生什么事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "727c4bc3bd809b19c648fb85ede2c3c550f2f62dd1fec2cedc4d58975c77c6d9", "ja": "二人とも、桃子が心配なのはわかるけど、まずは\nユニットのことだ。まだ話の途中だったよな？", "zh": "两位，我知道你们很担心桃子，但首先该讨论团体的事。\n我们才讲到一半而已对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6aa09f53cbcd442f1758b8029581a311f3a9951544692ecae01b21759fc4ddca", "ja": "まあ、そうだけど……。あれ？　ユニットと言えばさ、\nそもそも、なんでレトロなんだっけ？", "zh": "是没错啦……奇怪？说到团体，\n一开始怎么会说要走怀旧路线来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "ad0699c67147c86d82e374cb945724f997c393e88c0a1589a9ec0777bdf508e7", "ja": "えっと～。たしかロコが、{$P$}に\n駄菓子をもらったから、だよな？", "zh": "呃～我记得是因为ROCO拿到了\n{$P$}给的零嘴，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "03dfd962162e21663e61facaefb04dfee246e47ebd7e1ac23a8ad30126a5cd9b", "ja": "あ、そっか。駄菓子。駄菓子かぁ……。\nうーん……。", "zh": "啊，对耶。零嘴，零嘴啊……\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1eec40c73bd60f43c777057075665dafffc99ae887972250f7567e92a9b36dc", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　美咲から聞いたんだけど、懐かし\nミュージアムっていうのが近所にできたんだって！", "zh": "啊，对了！美咲有跟我说过\n附近好像新开了间怀旧博物馆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e4362ca070c179ec7eaf790232f5a10edf2587030aeb98b36ee6dd7b1c954ec5", "ja": "駄菓子も売ってるみたいだし、行ってみたら、\nなんか参考になるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "听说那边也有卖怀旧零嘴，去那里看看，\n可能会有值得参考的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "365342c494ff90f8363e4d835481fd451e17202158ba7e38b97ce84590de154b", "ja": "へえ～、面白そうじゃん。なぁ、ロコも行こうぜ！\n懐かしミュージアムだって！", "zh": "是喔～听起来很有趣嘛。欸，ROCO也一起去吧！\n听说有怀旧博物馆喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "554ce755df1c299b1ff28cb24b51f41c8a3ffc96b6df731fab48773ef8203038", "ja": "はっ。懐かしミュージアム……。\nインタレストです。行きましょう♪", "zh": "啊，怀旧博物馆……\nInterest，我们走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dc8a3f694e73ef53faec40c755c712d7caaa874b682ab111a60d6a5e9b420540", "ja": "（そんなわけで、懐かしミュージアムに向かった\n俺達だったが……）", "zh": "（于是，我们一行人前往了\n怀旧博物馆，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ea0f25b7a62360d462152255f7a38e3f4d5059ca5750ac3b31f5fbe5ee57c099", "ja": "あれっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "caad632cacf7d6e0332cf9ce2173ac5cdba8be38108ee725ba1c461a24490b09", "ja": "桃子！　なんでここにいるんだ……！？", "zh": "桃子！你怎么在这里……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "a110834a1b9255d6413ffa5fc518a199e7b5cc285e933a9048f79da5b521df73", "ja": "歩さんたちこそ……。もう、お兄ちゃん？\nこないでって言ったのに、どういうこと！？", "zh": "步姊你们才是……真是的，大哥哥，\n桃子不是说不要跟过来吗，这是怎么回事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "365201c15b1cb0e1536c52a69a1e32e12f252dd11575addae435629dd4f4ee94", "ja": "いや、俺が連れて来たわけじゃないよ。\n歩の発案で、みんなで来ることになったんだ。", "zh": "没啦，不是我带她们来的。\n大家是在步的提议下决定一起来这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "75727a2f6d21a5a5bd624121d78ac34a006234b2d65513aad39af579b7c5ba0d", "ja": "えっ。……そうなんだ。\n……ふーん。", "zh": "咦……是喔。\n……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "fa3189004355826f89bcc1a0bc83b2178b5dc26f81d654255b00508623d08fb5", "ja": "桃子はなんでここに？\n駄菓子、買いに来たのか？", "zh": "桃子你怎么会在这里啊？\n是来买零嘴的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "18f4f34177e36595eeb91dfcc19ff61fa934347789ee57b5b96b678cf03edb90", "ja": "あ！　もしかして……\n桃子もユニットのこと考えて、それで！？", "zh": "啊！该不会……\n桃子也是为了团体着想才来的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "b1b8c7b1dc1407097be447e9ce31c2dbdedf90d0dfb38be3e247e3b9b0937b7a", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと、歩さん。\n他のお客さんもいるんだから大声出さないで。", "zh": "等、等等，步姊。\n旁边还有其他参观的人，不要讲话那么大声啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8f6d01f587efc7bc75604cdf641c5809cbb983696844c5e2b508d5c0ebc0db2c", "ja": "そ、そっか。ごめん……。", "zh": "对、对耶，抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "1dbc211587c7197ef05d7f89df5cfbad04e4548f426944bcfe196488cae8404a", "ja": "『レトロ』って、桃子だけわからなかったから……\n勉強するのは当たり前だよ。", "zh": "只有桃子不了解什么是『复古风』……\n本来就该多做点研究。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d763ffb4f5884fa61192938b9f9d99bc01e599a30d90944d57ffc75a1b776b92", "ja": "も、桃子ぉ……！", "zh": "桃、桃子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "70e9219baadfb84cefb6414dd7a1de6a65e81c67095afccc41fa097f1ae2e4cc", "ja": "桃子って、やっぱいいヤツだよな！\nなあ、ロコもそう思うだろ？", "zh": "桃子果然是很棒的伙伴呢！\nROCO你也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "d9f3e4f69c321003daf2df9880914151a7399bd86bcbf410a25e135ef7a38a3b", "ja": "……ここの内装……とってもキュートです。\nレトロで……ポップで……ノスタルジック……。", "zh": "……这里的装潢……非常Cute。\n既复古……又时髦……而且Nostalgic……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5385f65f66aca9f8070a3a74e78f6046ac24f4b5b07d5e8341b46c303321e50b", "ja": "ろ、ロコ～！\n少しは話を聞いてくれよ～！", "zh": "RO、ROCO～！\n你也听一下我们说话嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "196b83c95de0af9f80cd904c7aeaea3d8c30fb958855e5840be32eec35cde610", "ja": "はっ！\n{$P$}、紙とペンをください！", "zh": "啊！\n{$P$}，请给我纸笔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "969217ac6fe16aa388ee4a168777d59a6476ca920f3f169f9f0de43eb9862e5e", "ja": "紙とペン？　それなら手持ちのものが……\nあった。これを使ってくれ。", "zh": "纸笔？我身上应该有带……\n有了，你拿去用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "ccd4da890c17c7b9b8890ed10273bc677b8fec9d1984da653225d7f9b20ecf76", "ja": "サンクスです♪　さらさらさら……このデザインを\n活かすなら、バリエーションはこっちで……。", "zh": "Thanks♪（奋笔疾书）……想活用这项Design的话，\n就选这个Variation……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "368668c30d9cbcca8bcff0fba688bc1c51b7653b726254a6b82760712a347670", "ja": "（ロコは、すごい勢いで何かを紙に描き始めた。\nこれは……！）", "zh": "（ROCO充满气势地在纸上画起图来了。\n这是……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
